{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_07_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_07","title":"地堡防线","storyCode":"OD-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"cd0c913e79c4d200801894c3d6e6be6aaec91a7d41225fdd9378f15f653b1885","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"变异生物数量极多，防守领主宅邸的干员难以抵抗。干员战车决定掩护其他人去避难所躲避，自己要独自面对一切。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是没完没了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"他们到底造了多少这种鬼东西！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇！小心身后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"源石畸变体","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在搞什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领主小姐，帮我搭把手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好的!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......快跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要说话了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的腿......你......你，别管我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要说蠢话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我背你，快上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们又冲上来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"趁现在，快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"到这来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥克芬先生！你怎么上来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我实在是做不到待在下面干等着，我可也是罗德岛干员啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！帮大忙了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"准备引爆爆炸物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"三、二、一......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"只是短暂被击退，用不了多久它们还会再来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"它们......好像变少了一点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"“迎宾踏垫”已经用完了，我也没有子弹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"亚历山大，接下来怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"去避难所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"去避难所！带着罗德岛的干员，去避难所！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我掩护你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"掩护？那谁掩护你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要掩护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点，亚历山大！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经受够了不停地躲藏和撤退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"撤退无法带来战争的胜利，历史无数次证明了这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们不是在打仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"对我来说，这就是在打仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"当他们向感染者掏出武器，想要加害我所熟识之人时，这就是一场战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我这辈子经历的战争太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我在这里多干掉一只该死的怪物，那些镇民存活下来的几率就会上升。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我就会守在这里，直到弹尽粮绝，直到天昏地暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"战争没有结束，我为什么要撤退？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己说过不要逞英雄的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我不觉得这是“逞英雄”，蒂娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在做对的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，这一切都得在今天结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"亚历山大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我会留下来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生，怎么你也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"事情总归会变成这样，从你们决定留下来帮忙的时候，其实大家都预料到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我会留下来，和这位战士协助防守，如果情况太糟，我可以掩护他撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"亚历山大，给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己试做的源石爆炸物，只剩下这两个了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"活着！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不敢保证。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"你没和她说实话，你也没打算撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......你就不要戳穿我这个老头子的小算盘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要有人帮你顶住那些怪物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年迈的游侠拿出一把长刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"据说是老领主的佩刀，我借来用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"这把刀很好，老领主的品位很不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"漂亮的花纹钢，手工镶嵌的松绿石刀柄，不比那些现代工业生产的武器差多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"比起冲在最前线，拿着弓箭在后方要安全得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年迈的萨弗拉游侠舞动了弯刃的长刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我老了，动作迟钝了许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这把刀，依旧是锋利的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我还一直都不知道你的名字，战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"亚历山大·塞纳维耶夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我亚历山大就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我也应该告诉你我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"但是从鲜血涂抹山谷的那天起，我的名字也随着过去的一切掩盖在黄沙之下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"你决定留下战斗，这很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"“巡林者”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"“当时他们都说我要死了，但是他们错了，我重生了。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"无论那些怪物有多少只。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"让它们放马过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["霜华"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["战车"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
